Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:05.00,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(459,1)}October 11th, Stellar Year 2149
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.25,sign_120_2___MISSING__,Onscreen,0,0,0,,- Time Since Mission Began -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:06.89,Italics Top,Shin,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.70,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Frederica.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:29.87,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,If I told you to ignore everybody \Nbut that idiot and go, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:37.80,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.03,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,They just don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:24.83,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,What about the Löwes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:26.37,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Still following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:29.29,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,They're traveling along the river \Nbelow the cliffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:31.58,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,How much longer until the Morpho?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:33.34,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,15K as the crow flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.88,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It moved a little and stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:39.55,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but we'll use \Nthis opportunity to get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.13,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It seems to be after something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:45.18,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Below! They're firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.36,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:02:57.48,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:02:59.24,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:02.49,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.28,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I'm not damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:08.62,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,But... sorry. I don't think \NI can climb back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:11.00,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Wait! I'll use my wire to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.58,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:16.67,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I'll handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:17.84,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,You guys go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.30,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:23.72,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Leave all the spare missile pods you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:30.48,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,More are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:31.64,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:33.06,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:39.90,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.91,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:51.66,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Time to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:03.72,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,How we looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:08.10,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,We shook them off, but another group\N is trying to block our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.35,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,They really don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:14.69,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,They'll get in our way when \Nwe're fighting the Morpho, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:23.24,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Once we're past this,\N it's just open plains, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:27.78,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I'm only useful in places like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.49,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,So I'll be a decoy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:33.08,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,I'll be as careful as I can. Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:39.13,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,They've split their group even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:42.05,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'm bringing shame \Nto the Nouzen clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.88,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,letting mere common soldiers \Nlike them find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:47.63,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:52.85,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll give you credit for being cold enough \Nto abandon your friends as you get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:57.02,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Pale Rider to wide-area network!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:00.02,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Now executing the designated \Nbombardment schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:03.99,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,No further communications will be allowed \Nuntil the schedule is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.49,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'm about to meet a comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:10.03,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,No one will interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.70,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:13.20,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.84,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He can shoot multiple rounds like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:21.34,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:25.09,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Go on, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:28.22,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,That was scattershot. \NIt won't deal heavy damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.14,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,A counterattack is incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.56,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:34.02,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,I can provide more support from here,\N because it's easier to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:37.60,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Get close while his attacks \Naren't concentrated!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:38.48,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:41.86,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:45.57,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.24,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.04,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'm tired of these little flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:58.54,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Even those who aren't invited \Nare getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:01.84,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Anyone who interferes \Nmust be eliminated immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:20.44,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Kurena!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:23.73,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Raiden, above us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:36.79,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Raiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:37.50,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.46,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,He was trying to protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.47,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.96,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,It won't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:45.05,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,But... sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:47.30,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,I'm out of the game now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.64,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Frederica, get aboard Fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:57.68,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Wehrwolf lost the legs \Non its right side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.31,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It can't go any farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:00.94,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Raiden...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:02.69,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.90,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,The next attack is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:08.11,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:10.49,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:19.00,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:20.46,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:28.84,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.05,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.48,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:41.27,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,You're staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:44.73,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Fido will stay and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:45.65,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:48.90,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,If something happens to me, \Ntake Frederica back to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.70,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Don't worry about recovering the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:54.28,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Get her back to the Federacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:56.12,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Open up, Fido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.87,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I need to tell that idiot directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:58.54,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Frederica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:03.74,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You're scared to lose him, but you want to save him anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:04.96,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Your knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:11.59,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Survive, so you can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:18.51,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:23.19,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I can't wait to rip you apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:26.02,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Now, come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:28.02,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Come! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:30.28,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Come! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:55.72,Flashback,Raiden,0,0,0,,So... \NDon't try to fight on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.61,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:10.52,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.48,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.53,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.49,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:18.28,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:21.37,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:22.87,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:26.92,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.96,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:33.34,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:37.05,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.24,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Incredible moves...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:08.83,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Just as I was hoping for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.13,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm still too far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:16.55,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:21.51,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,When I'm fighting, \NI can forget everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:26.10,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's nice and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.02,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:35.69,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You want to go help your master, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:38.36,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,If it weren't for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:44.37,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Let's at least watch\N their battle to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:04.68,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,You think I can't shoot you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:20.74,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,He was trying to make me overheat \Nfrom the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.03,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,A plan worthy of the eldest sons \Nof the Nouzen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:30.58,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,If you'd been by my side, \Nthe Empire would yet stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:35.54,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'd love to have your power \Non our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.59,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,But I guess you're too strong \Nto take that risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:45.05,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Yes, you have to get close \Nto pierce my armor with those tiny guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:48.72,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,But don't you think \Nyou're being a little reckless?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:55.23,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,Do you know about Shin's \Nlegendary point-blank shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:59.90,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,He sent a Vánagandr flying \Nduring a mock battle at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:02.57,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,He did it to avoid a collision,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.20,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,but he failed due to dangerous piloting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.79,Flashback,Frederica,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.12,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:13.67,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I wasn't surprised then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.38,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Because I knew already...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:23.34,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,There's another person out there \Nwho can do the impossible in a Feldreß.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:26.05,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,No, Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:28.06,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Don't get close to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:32.14,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri was just like you! \NClose combat was his specialty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.91,0:12:52.54,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:53.75,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:57.88,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Don't interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.51,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Raiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.47,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Enough, Raiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:07.55,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:40.96,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,One round left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:43.26,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Engines at their limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:45.72,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Wingmen all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:47.55,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:49.89,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The enemy is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:53.56,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Enemy main guns and subweapons \Nare still functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:58.03,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,This may be... the end, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:03.03,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Go, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:04.03,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:04.94,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:05.90,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.65,0:14:07.86,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,I won't forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.65,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,While you still can, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.69,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,You're still interfering?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:49.78,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:17.27,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You won't let me get close, \Nno matter what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:45.17,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:46.88,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I can fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:52.01,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Pierce me with a hail of bullets, \Nrip my body apart, and I can still fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.93,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll die here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:58.39,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,But I can still kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:00.43,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.81,0:16:03.35,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Why do you insist on fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:07.02,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to kill everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:10.69,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You don't know his name. \NYou don't know his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:15.32,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,But he shares your blood. \NHe's the only comrade you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.91,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,You know why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:24.63,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Because this is all I have left!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:26.50,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,All I have is the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:30.13,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,The battlefield that burns in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.88,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,It burns my soul to ash,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:38.14,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,so only the empty, \Nsmoldering flames of war remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:40.14,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:45.23,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,On that day, I lost everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:48.44,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Even you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:56.03,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,If you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:57.92,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,If you're going to be the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.87,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,If you're going to be like me, \Nthen it's better that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.01,0:17:13.67,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:22.47,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten your master's face, \NKiriya Nouzen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:25.86,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:29.69,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Stop fighting, Kiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.23,Italics,Kiriya,0,0,0,,You have no reason to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:35.86,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.45,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:39.03,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:42.88,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,You've done well, my knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.63,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:53.51,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Not only did you destroy my Empire\Nand steal its crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:56.55,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,but now you're using the young princess \Nas a hostage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:04.93,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri! Stop it, Kiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:08.19,Italics Top,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:12.27,Italics Top,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.27,0:18:32.84,Italics Top,Kiriya,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:18.86,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:21.24,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.08,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:26.08,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:27.92,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:29.79,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.13,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:32.84,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:44.26,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Look at me, Kiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:03.53,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,What's wrong, my knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:05.49,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Come on. Save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:08.37,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess! What are you doing, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:10.79,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess! Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:13.96,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,We finally meet again, and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:16.05,Flashback,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.63,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:20.51,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:22.09,Flashback_Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:49.82,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Frederica.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:52.58,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Where is your knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.71,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.84,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Behind the main gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:02.00,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Between the first pair of wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.05,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Between the first pair of wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.47,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:37.59,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"Shin."
